  "description": "A condition reads the nearest occurrence of its question by the FHIR R4 rule: the ancestor axis, then the preceding axis, then the following axis. A question before the gated item in a repeating group is read in the same instance; a question after it is read in the previous instance, except in the first; items under a question's answers read the whole question; a question inside a repeating group read from outside it, or one after the gated item inside the group, is reported as a cross-instance reference.",
